sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Route 53
    participant E as CloudFront/WAF
    participant L as ALB
    participant A as Patient API
    participant D as Aurora PostgreSQL
    participant B as EventBridge
    participant Q as SQS
    participant W as Worker
    participant S as S3

    C->>R: DNS resolution
    R->>E: Active-region routing
    E->>L: HTTPS request
    L->>A: Forward request
    A->>D: Transactional metadata
    A->>B: Publish clinical event
    B->>Q: Durable delivery
    Q->>W: Event delivery
    W->>W: Validate + deduplicate
    W->>D: Persist processing state
    W->>S: Store object/event artifact when applicable
    W-->>Q: Delete after successful processing
